      "start_codepoint": 20,
      "end_codepoint": 47,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:received_sentence2-47",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "258_ae3_26e_AAA",
      "source_quote": "弘之時在江陵，與仄兄子彬謀殺荊州刺史桓石康，以荊州刺史應仄。",
      "reading": "弘之與仄兄子庾彬謀，欲以荊州應仄。",
      "note": "弘之與仄兄子庾彬謀，欲以荊州應仄。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 47,
      "end_codepoint": 77,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:received_sentence2-77",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "258_ae3_26e_AAA",
      "source_quote": "彬從弟宏知其謀，以告石康，石康收彬殺之，繫弘之於獄。",
