      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "258_ae3_26e_AAA",
      "source_quote": "桓玄以弘之非造謀，又白衣無兵眾，原不罪。",
      "reading": "桓玄認弘之無兵且非首謀，赦不罪。",
      "note": "桓玄認弘之無兵且非首謀，赦不罪。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 103,
      "end_codepoint": 123,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
