    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "258_ae3_26e_AAA",
      "source_quote": "高祖北伐，弘之與扶風太守沈田子等七軍自武關入，偽上洛太守脫身奔走，進據藍田，招懷戎、晉。",
      "reading": "劉裕北伐，弘之與沈田子等入武關進據藍田，上洛太守脫身逃，未名。",
      "note": "劉裕北伐，弘之與沈田子等入武關進據藍田，上洛太守脫身逃，未名。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 44,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:received_sentence4-44",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "258_ae3_26e_AAA",
      "source_quote": "晉人龐斌之、戴養、胡人康橫等各率部落歸化。",
      "reading": "晉人龐斌之、戴養及胡人康橫等率部落歸附。",
      "note": "晉人龐斌之、戴養及胡人康橫等率部落歸附。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 44,
      "end_codepoint": 65,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:received_sentence4-65",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "258_ae3_26e_AAA",
      "source_quote": "弘之素善騎乘，高祖至長安，弘之於姚泓馳道內，緩服戲馬，或馳或驟，往反二十里中，甚有姿制，羌胡聚觀者數千人，並驚惋歎息。",
      "reading": "記弘之於姚泓馳道戲馬，馳驟往反二十里，觀者數千。",
      "note": "記弘之於姚泓馳道戲馬，馳驟往反二十里，觀者數千。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 65,
      "end_codepoint": 124,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:received_sentence4-124",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "258_ae3_26e_AAA",
      "source_quote": "初上馬，以馬鞭柄策，挽致兩股內，及下馬，柄孔猶存。",
      "reading": "記鞭柄留痕。",
      "note": "記鞭柄留痕。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 124,
      "end_codepoint": 149,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
