      "end_codepoint": 42,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:received_sentence5-42",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "258_ae3_26e_AAA",
      "source_quote": "高祖歸後，佛佛偽太子赫連瓌率眾三萬襲長安，弘之又領步騎五千，於池陽大破之，殺傷甚眾。",
      "reading": "宋書稱夏太子赫連瓌率三萬襲長安，弘之於池陽交戰。",
      "note": "宋書稱夏太子赫連瓌率三萬襲長安，弘之於池陽交戰。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 42,
      "end_codepoint": 84,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:received_sentence5-84",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "258_ae3_26e_AAA",
      "source_quote": "瓌又抄掠渭南，弘之又於寡婦人渡破瓌，獲賊三百，掠七千餘口。",
      "reading": "瓌再至渭南，弘之於寡婦人渡擊之，有獲虜、人口之數。",
      "note": "瓌再至渭南，弘之於寡婦人渡擊之，有獲虜、人口之數。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 84,
      "end_codepoint": 113,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
